<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background:#f5f7fb;padding:40px 20px;">
  <div style="max-width:500px;margin:auto;background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:10px;">
    <h2 style="margin-top:0;color:#222;">Invoice from {{companyName}}</h2>

    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>Please find your invoice attached to this email.</p>

    <div style="background:#f5f5f5;padding:20px;border-radius:8px;margin:20px 0;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Invoice number:</strong> {{invoiceNumber}}</p>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px;"><strong>Billing period:</strong> {{billingMonth}}/{{billingYear}}</p>
      <p style="margin:0;"><strong>Total amount:</strong> INR {{totalAmount}}</p>
    </div>

    <p>If you have any questions about this invoice, please contact us.</p>

    <p style="margin-bottom:0;">Regards,<br />IEKA Team</p>
  </div>
</div>
